{"synopsis":"Dunia manusia diselimuti ketakutan akan hal yang tidak diketahui. Untuk bertahan hidup, beberapa orang yang terbangun bangkit untuk bertarung. Yilin, seorang pria sial yang tidak bisa menjadi pahlawan tepat waktu, secara tragis dibunuh ketika dia membunuh bosnya. Tanpa diduga, ia dilahirkan kembali dan memperoleh kemampuan sebagai pemimpin penjahat. Dia awalnya adalah orang biasa tetapi dia menjadi musuh seumur hidup dari dewa dan iblis yang tak terhitung jumlahnya. Hei, kalian, sudah terlambat untuk berlutut sekarang…","alternative_title":"저는 악당이 아닙니다","author":"Team the J, Haejun, Junsol, Rhy-Me, SMA","artist":"Samacho","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"68368dd4-9424-4b2b-b10b-a558c2455816","number":"164","chapter":"164","title":"Chapter 164","date":"2026-06-11","released":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"80837890-9c66-4561-97d8-3fa08a0a5771","number":"163","chapter":"163","title":"Chapter 163","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fd8165d0-3b59-43c2-83f2-f317c4d71bac","number":"162","chapter":"162","title":"Chapter 162","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6b20e859-2695-4575-8b22-da09f231b1c0","number":"161","chapter":"161","title":"Chapter 161","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f570e4ab-b9d3-4b04-a0f4-6d98243f5296","number":"160","chapter":"160","title":"Chapter 160","date":"2025-12-28","released":"2025-12-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"35fbdb29-8a75-4c9d-ae8d-b936f5f8affd","number":"159","chapter":"159","title":"Chapter 159","date":"2025-12-28","released":"2025-12-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"062e27d1-c9d7-4046-91d2-1a28a0b18c43","number":"158","chapter":"158","title":"Chapter 158","date":"2025-12-17","released":"2025-12-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7778d019-8553-4968-9d4e-5a109fe86e18","number":"157","chapter":"157","title":"Chapter 157","date":"2025-12-16","released":"2025-12-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"4a3a9c2e-6ba5-451d-8d05-fe